WEBVTT

00:11:26.287 --> 00:11:30.454
and it influences our daily lives
in meaningful ways.

00:11:31.496 --> 00:11:35.329
So the next time that you
watch the History Channel,

00:11:35.371 --> 00:11:37.996
read an archeology book

00:11:38.037 --> 00:11:39.996
or view a public monument,

00:11:40.037 --> 00:11:43.912
remember that every statement
about the past

00:11:43.954 --> 00:11:46.996
is a powerful statement about the present.

00:11:47.746 --> 00:11:48.996
Thank you.